e; the loop redraws each tick, so this sets the\n/// visible spin rate.\nconst SPINNER_FRAME_MS: u128 = 100;\n/// Maximum total characters of a single prompt before it is rejected.\n/// Generous on purpose: very long prompts must","next_offset":4096,"offset":0,"sha256":"sha256:4887f34874c65ab3ab32a738941c7a42cba18744957a9a3e5fabfc65d83d3076","total_bytes":138596}

